OL,3,GNEWSASixty police officers recruited
OL,4,Afor new Bee Network unit
OL,5,
OL,6,FSixty police officer have been
OL,7,Frecruited to patrol Greater
OL,8,FManchester's trams and buses.
OL,10,FThe new Transport Policing and Crime
OL,11,FCommand has been created to tackle
OL,12,Fcrime and antisocial behaviour on the
OL,13,FBee Network.
OL,15,FThe new squad will deliver a
OL,16,F"significant increase" in visible
OL,17,Fpolicing and enforcement across the
OL,18,Ftransport network, Greater Manchester
OL,19,FPolice (GMP) said.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
