OL,3,GNEWSASixty police officers recruited
OL,4,Afor new Bee Network unit
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe dedicated unit, which will also
OL,7,Fcover the city's active travel routes
OL,8,Fand roads, has been formed with funding
OL,9,Ffrom the Mayor of Greater Manchester's
OL,10,Fbudget.
